---
/* WHY WE EXIST — the aperture: two joined panels that open width-then-height,
  revealing text, with a video exposed alongside. See HERO_CHOREOGRAPHY.md-
  adjacent notes in STATUS.md for the taste-loop history behind this shape. */
---
<section class="why g-ink" id="why" data-fade>
  <div class="why__inner" data-placeholder="P8">
    <p class="eyebrow">Why we exist</p>

    <p class="why__lead">It started with a handful of people in a room in Warri,
       trading half-finished songs and rough cuts.</p>

    <div class="why__stage">
      <!-- THE APERTURE: two illustrations joined, which open — width first,
           then height, and the height is what reveals the text. -->
      <div class="why__aperture" id="whyAp">
        <div class="why__panels">
          <div class="why__panel" data-placeholder="P4"><img src="/img/who-01.webp" alt=""></div>
          <div class="why__panel" data-placeholder="P4"><img src="/img/who-03.webp" alt=""></div>
        </div>

        <div class="why__rooms">
          <p class="why__text"><span class="why__reveal">The places that took the craft seriously didn&rsquo;t know what to do
             with the faith.</span></p>
          <p class="why__text"><span class="why__reveal">The places that took the faith seriously didn&rsquo;t take the craft
             seriously at all.</span></p>
        </div>

        <p class="why__mid"><span class="why__reveal">Everyone we knew was choosing between two rooms, and losing something
           in whichever one they picked.</span></p>

        <div class="why__third">
          <p class="why__resolve"><span class="why__reveal">So we stopped choosing,<br>and made a third room.</span></p>
          <p class="why__tail"><span class="why__reveal">That&rsquo;s all The Glow Tribe is: the room we couldn&rsquo;t find.</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- the film, exposed as the aperture opens. preload="none" and
           poster-first: 3MB on a Nigerian mobile connection (SC7) is not
           something to spend before a visitor has reached the section. -->
      <figure class="why__film">
        <video id="whyFilm" muted loop playsinline preload="none"
               poster="/vid/film-poster.jpg" data-placeholder="P6">
          <source src="/vid/film.webm" type="video/webm">
          <source src="/vid/film.mp4"  type="video/mp4">
        </video>
        <figcaption class="why__cap">On the set</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
